  "about": {
    "html": "<p>At the <strong>European Institute of Design (IED)</strong>, I developed a definitive visual language alongside strong project management skills, bridging the gap between cinema theory and modern aesthetics. </p><p>I am equipped to oversee a project’s entire lifecycle — from the initial creative direction and scriptwriting, all the way to the final execution.</p><p class=\"gap\">My portfolio is built on versatility and impact. </p><p>I work as a <strong>Director</strong> across <strong>advertising, social media campaigns, and documentaries</strong>. </p><p>In the <strong>cinematic</strong> field, I shape the visual narrative as a <strong>Director of Photography</strong>, while also bringing my technical expertise to other film projects as a <strong>Camera Operator</strong>.</p><p class=\"gap\">My vision is backed by top-tier industry exposure. Embedded within the Olympic Broadcasting Services for the <strong>Milano-Cortina 2026 Winter Olympic and Paralympic Games</strong>, I gained inside access to elite live-production workflows and broadcast camera systems, absorbing the mechanics of the highest-pressure environment in the industry.</p><p class=\"gap\">From polished commercials to gritty documentaries, I bring a tailored, cinematic approach to every frame.</p><p class=\"gap\"><strong>Quality is the only metric.<br>Contact me to collaborate.</strong></p>",
    "button": "CONTACT ME!"
  },
